[center][size=6][color=#93c47d][b]Unholy Genessa v0.3.0[/b][/color][/size][/center]

[b]Added[/b]
[list]
[*]Facial-expression support for both Eve Skin and Genessa Skin, including supported CSS performances and CINE playback.
[*]Facial Expression selection in Customize, saved with your profiles.
[*]52 additional idle animations through CSS Shared Assets.
[/list]
[img]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ngodn/CustomShellSystem/e06a567a9201fc688203fef2ceddf3412957c217/docs/media/v1.0.0/unholy-genessa.jpg[/img]

[b]Fixes and improvements[/b]
[list]
[*]Improved rear-cloth behavior in the world.
[*]Improved hair motion while preserving the existing wing movement and clothing controls.
[*]Updated compatibility with the combined CSS Shared Assets package and customized Genessa doubles.
[/list]

Close the game, update CSS to v1.0.1 and install its matching CSS Shared Assets download. Replace the previous Unholy Genessa package with all three files from this download. Keep your CSS settings and profiles.

Minor cloth clipping can remain in some poses and in the customization preview.
